`Bin(m, 1/2)`, before the final numerical simplification in (1.6). -/
theorem binomialHalf_lowerQuarter_le_chernoff (m : ℕ) :
    Bin(ℝ, m, (⟨1 / 2, by norm_num⟩ : unitInterval)).real
        {x | x ≤ (m : ℝ) / 4} ≤
      (Real.exp (Real.log 3 / 4) * (2 / 3 : ℝ)) ^ m := by
