count whenever the part count dominates `logOrder`. -/
theorem midpointPartialSignedFirstMomentLogError_isLittleO_of_logOrder
    (alpha K : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hAdmissible : ∀ᶠ n : ℕ in atTop,
