/-- The sharper four-size certificate: for `0 ≤ δ ≤ 1`,
`0 ≤ D₄(δ) < log (127/100)` and `A₄(δ) > log (200/127)`. -/
theorem sharp_four_size_entropy_certificate (delta : ℝ)
