1. **(Unconstrained infinite `S_{≥ m₁}` vs finite window `S_{m₂, M₂}`):**
   for all `m₁ ≤ 2`, `m₂ ≤ 1`, `7 ≤ M₂ ≤ M`, `τ₁, τ₂ ∈ [0, log 2]`, and corridor zeros `r₁, r₂`,
