/-- **Unconditional Proposition 7.3 & Corollary 8.1 in `Regime U` (`main.tex` lines 1096–1104, 1152–1160):**
for every `7 ≤ M`, `m ≤ 1`, and `δ_- ∈ (x₀, 1 + δ_*]`, there exist `C_corr > 0` and `C_sm > 0`
such that eventually whenever `δ_n + m ∈ [δ_-, 1 + δ_*]`:
